    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing and strike through hordes of monsters in this retro-inspired classicvania. Smash lanterns to collect spells and powers that will help the SNAKE and the WITCH survive against the dark forces that have begun to emanate from the school they once called home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/e0694c920b5acfd2567c7cd3c57277f7.poster.avif?t=1749172879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/e0694c920b5acfd2567c7cd3c57277f7.webm?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/e0694c920b5acfd2567c7cd3c57277f7.mp4?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the banished Witch and her accursed Snake companion be able to prove their worth before the dark forces overtaking their home can stop them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The SNAKEWITCH was unceremoniously exiled from The Academy for summoning the forbidden Snake Spirit. A year later, the fated return of the na\u00efve Witch and the accursed Snake will have horrific implications...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/50118c655eaa9e13ce7a62f459b9b6c4.poster.avif?t=1749172879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/50118c655eaa9e13ce7a62f459b9b6c4.webm?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/50118c655eaa9e13ce7a62f459b9b6c4.mp4?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a gripping, personal tale</strong>\u00a0of overcoming the odds and proving the innocence of the reviled snake against a power-obsessed headmaster</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>classic, whip-like action combat</strong> across nail-biting, difficult platforming sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a variety of interesting offensive and defensive spells</strong> that harness the power of both heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>branching upgrade paths</strong> allow you to spend the currency you've collected along the way to change the way you battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>an energetic, funky soundtrack</strong>\u00a0that drives the action forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a handcrafted world</strong> drawn and animated in a slick pixel-art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/a187e2e4ac29b0824a77b96589d72924.avif?t=1749172879\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing and strike through hordes of monsters in this retro-inspired classicvania. Smash lanterns to collect spells and powers that will help the SNAKE and the WITCH survive against the dark forces that have begun to emanate from the school they once called home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/e0694c920b5acfd2567c7cd3c57277f7.poster.avif?t=1749172879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/e0694c920b5acfd2567c7cd3c57277f7.webm?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/e0694c920b5acfd2567c7cd3c57277f7.mp4?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the banished Witch and her accursed Snake companion be able to prove their worth before the dark forces overtaking their home can stop them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The SNAKEWITCH was unceremoniously exiled from The Academy for summoning the forbidden Snake Spirit. A year later, the fated return of the na\u00efve Witch and the accursed Snake will have horrific implications...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/50118c655eaa9e13ce7a62f459b9b6c4.poster.avif?t=1749172879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/50118c655eaa9e13ce7a62f459b9b6c4.webm?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/50118c655eaa9e13ce7a62f459b9b6c4.mp4?t=1749172879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a gripping, personal tale</strong>\u00a0of overcoming the odds and proving the innocence of the reviled snake against a power-obsessed headmaster</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>classic, whip-like action combat</strong> across nail-biting, difficult platforming sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a variety of interesting offensive and defensive spells</strong> that harness the power of both heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>branching upgrade paths</strong> allow you to spend the currency you've collected along the way to change the way you battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>an energetic, funky soundtrack</strong>\u00a0that drives the action forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a handcrafted world</strong> drawn and animated in a slick pixel-art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761390/extras/a187e2e4ac29b0824a77b96589d72924.avif?t=1749172879\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The action-packed tale of the exiled SNAKEWITCH. Swing and strike your way through cursed areas, battling monsters and freeing possessed creatures along the way. With your snake companion, break into the Academy and discover the true reason that the accursed SNAKEWITCH was banished.",
